@startuml registration_appointment_camp_erd
' Generated from the Django models (care + hmis). Regenerate rather than edit by hand.
' created_by_id / updated_by_id columns point to users_user; those lines are left out to keep the layout readable.
' Legend: * = NOT NULL, <<PK>> primary key, <<FK table>> foreign key, <<UQ>> unique
hide circle
skinparam ranksep 60
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam entity {
  BackgroundColor #FFFFFF
  BorderColor #555555
}
title Registration, Appointment and Health Camp tables

